<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>PreferenceSpecifiers</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>Opens the app straight to the settings menu. Useful if you changed anything there and need to change it back but the app won&apos;t start.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Recovery Mode</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>recovery</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Open Diagnostics On Launch</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>openDiagnosticsOnLaunch</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Initial Window</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>Initial Window</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>terminal</string>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Workspace</string>
				<string>Choose Filesystem</string>
				<string>Terminal (tty1)</string>
				<string>Session Shell (pts/1)</string>
			</array>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>workspace</string>
				<string>choose-filesystem</string>
				<string>terminal</string>
				<string>session-shell</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Simulated Swap</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>Lets iSH-AOK move cold guest memory out to storage, so a large mostly-idle heap or a background process tree stops counting against the memory iOS allows the app. It will not make a working set that is genuinely too big run well.

Off unless you turn it on: swapping writes to the device&apos;s flash, and the swap area takes up that much space in the app&apos;s container while it exists. Both settings take effect the next time iSH-AOK starts, and swap stays off until you have chosen a size as well as switched it on.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Enable Swap</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>Enable Swap</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Swap Size</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>Swap Size MB</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Not chosen (swap stays off)</string>
				<string>256 MB</string>
				<string>512 MB</string>
				<string>1 GB</string>
				<string>2 GB</string>
				<string>4 GB</string>
				<string>8 GB</string>
				<string>16 GB</string>
			</array>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>256</integer>
				<integer>512</integer>
				<integer>1024</integer>
				<integer>2048</integer>
				<integer>4096</integer>
				<integer>8192</integer>
				<integer>16384</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
